{"id":"vod_sn_38855","vodId":"38855","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年好莱坞第一季","name_cn":"少年好莱坞第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/44787caec8298e072ffca6bd61fc162b.jpg"},"summary":"在一个门可罗雀的小剧场内，风见飒（逢坂良太 配音）、甘木生马（柿原彻也 配音）佐伯希星（山下大辉 配音）、富井大树（苍井翔太 配音）和舞山春（小野贤章 配音）等五个还未满20岁的青年在负责人敕使河原恭一（新田将司 配音）的监督下刻苦训练，朝着偶像的梦想进发。15年前，他们的前辈组合少年好莱坞曾让小剧场日日爆满。社长（浪川大辅 饰）带有蛊惑性的言语为少年们描绘了美好的未来，而各种各样专属于圈内的规定和习惯也让青年们手足无措。蜿蜒曲折的偶像之路，交织着欢笑、汗水和眼泪，男孩们一天天成长为闪耀的明星……　　本片根据桥口育世的小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WPx6fBHGPF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H5AiL9S7xX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UfGc4ZaDX01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tqcVRuSTZK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wXDKK9j2mp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TEv9xx7yEX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r5f1Xn8N1U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hJ01iY3n3d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8GcEu7T21p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K0NVGceWpv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ai17tmY3j81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J2MTbuPWCT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/egGtnYiTpX1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.897Z"}